      "id": "claim_9c6e70cc9e6a4c22a5141400e8f5c4ad",
      "statement": "FeedFetcher is the single component performing outbound HTTP retrieval of caller-supplied URLs, shared by feed polling/subscribe (FeedService/FeedPollingService) and reader-view article extraction (ArticleExtractionService).",
