    {
      "id": "claim_44a8752322054f199e7bc5a013966e6c",
      "statement": "FeedFetcher.fetch validates the URL via FeedUrlValidator before issuing any network call, so the SSRF guard runs unconditionally on every fetch.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/org/bartram/myfeeder/service/FeedFetcher.java#L46-L48",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f128f99e72198dfdd457a1cb5c1f2f8d66f40e7242685baa77346658bc05af7e:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_1473ced991ba4bbb8a1d72f85721e710",
      "statement": "FeedUrlValidator requires an http/https scheme and rejects hosts resolving to loopback, link-local, RFC1918 site-local, any-local (0.0.0.0), multicast, IPv6 unique-local (fc00::/7), IPv4-mapped IPv6 wrapping any blocked address, or carrier-grade NAT (100.64.0.0/10) addresses, throwing IllegalArgumentException (mapped to HTTP 400) on rejection.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/org/bartram/myfeeder/controller/GlobalExceptionHandler.java#L44-L49",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d33e9d155eda6eae41ede4fedb52c50b757fc100ed9a4a593ee1972a6812be78:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/org/bartram/myfeeder/service/FeedUrlValidator.java#L49-L134",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5656078127759ebf3461ab374fec9653aecad8c3af07c5f9fcdb7dca2e08158a:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_0acb98ac895f41f284327670ef9a36ae",
      "statement": "FeedUrlValidator documents two accepted limitations for its single-user LAN deployment target: it is TOCTOU-vulnerable to DNS rebinding because RestClient re-resolves the host at connect time after validation resolves it separately, and it does not re-validate redirect targets per hop.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/org/bartram/myfeeder/service/FeedUrlValidator.java#L18-L26",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:920eb8f3039628d60a90558f14cc549d14555b5ee2b22effbbaa58b65f8a097d:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_9b0cbcd649db4dfeabbf4cc4d57ab86c",
      "statement": "FeedFetcher bounds the response body read to DEFAULT_MAX_FEED_BYTES (10 MiB) using readNBytes(maxFeedBytes + 1), throwing FeedFetchException (mapped to HTTP 422 by GlobalExceptionHandler) if the body exceeds the cap or the response status is 4xx/5xx; a 304 response short-circuits without a body read; the cap is overridable via a package-private constructor for tests.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/org/bartram/myfeeder/controller/GlobalExceptionHandler.java#L23-L28",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d2bd6663464a66ac5751f7379d9d7426c0821557a6b19f9b87fc9a88185b2aba:"
